    <unit id="=&gt;q4" name="=&gt;q4">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">8</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hello! Allow me to present to you the most exceptional brew you'll ever taste. ::He picks up two seemingly identical bottles, one in each hand.:: Here, I've brought my trusty companion, *Sniffles*, to perform an experiment that will prove the worth of my unique drink!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a5" name="=&gt;a5">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">10</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Alright, show me.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q6" name="=&gt;q6">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">12</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Just as he is about to begin, a number of bystanders turn around to witness the event.:: In my left hand I have a regular, boring, everyday mushroom brew. In my right hand, I have my special, one of a kind, Cave Tear. Behold as Sniffles tastes them both. ::He laughs.:: See the difference for yourself. 

::First, he serves the mushroom brew to the pig by placing it down on to the floor. The beast immediately envelops the neck of the bottle with its mouth, lifting it off the floor with ease. It holds the glass at an angle, and in a single breath, drinks its substance all the way through like it was nothing. Then, out of frustration, the pig tosses the bottle away.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q7" name="=&gt;q7">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">14</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::It would seem like that pig was not satisfied. It looks around for more by making some unpleasant noises, sniffing the boots of the brewer in process.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q8" name="=&gt;q8">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">16</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>My friend here is not happy, it seems. The beverage was too weak! ::He places the other drink on the ground and picks up the empty bottle.:: Now, let's give our buddy what he truly needs: Cave Tear!

::Just like the last time, the pig wastes no time going after the brew. Except now, the consumption part doesn't go as smooth as before. It takes the pig several attempts to finish the drink off. Once it does so, it places the empty bottle on the floor as it was served, upright and still.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q9" name="=&gt;q9">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">18</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::The pig lays down to take some rest. It closes its restless eyes, and unleashes a single reverberating burp. All that remains are the gentle tail swings, indicating that the beast is quite calm.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q10" name="=&gt;q10">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">20</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>There you have it! A beverage capable of pacifying a swine! This is the definitive proof of my excellence! If you're still unsure if this is the brew you're looking for, you can try one out for free - right here! If you'd like to try some more, you'll have to get it from Jessie. Cheers!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a11" name="=&gt;a11">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">22</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Good stuff. I'd like to try some myself.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q12" name="=&gt;q12">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">24</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Here you go! ::He gives you one Cave Tear.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a13" name="=&gt;a13">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">26</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Cheers! ::Leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a14" name="=&gt;a14">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">28</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>This is some sort of trick. Whatever...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a15" name="=&gt;a15">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">30</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Turn around and leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a16" name="=&gt;a16">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">32</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>What kind of brew is this?&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q17" name="=&gt;q17">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">34</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Cave Tear! Kilo for kilo the strongest brew you'll ever get a chance to taste! And if the name sounds weird, worry not - if you'll allow me, I'll demonstrate its quality.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q18" name="=&gt;q18">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">36</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Cave Tear has arrived to Drag 'n' Drop! Have at it!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a19" name="=&gt;a19">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">38</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Hey, I'd like to try some more. You know, for free...&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q20" name="=&gt;q20">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">40</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Uhhh, if you've missed the free servings, I'm afraid you're all out of luck. Jessie will be serving the rest of the stock, and not for free. Sorry. ::He looks away.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a21" name="=&gt;a21">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">42</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::[Intimidation]:: Look, you don't want to make me put in a bad word about your dealings here. Stingy, disrespectful, rude, stuff like that, you get the idea. Now drop me some freebies and we can call it quits.&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q22" name="=&gt;q22">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">44</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I-I didn't mean t-to insult you... ::He looks confused.:: Uhh, here, here, I'll give you a couple just don't spread bad rumors about me... ::He quickly pulls out a couple of drinks and hands them over to you.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a23" name="=&gt;a23">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">46</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>I'm glad we came to a mutual understanding. ::Take the drinks and leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;q24" name="=&gt;q24">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">48</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You're bluffing! ::He shouts.:: Go ahead, do your worst, freeloader! ::He crosses his arms and even the pig gets aggravated.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a25" name="=&gt;a25">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">50</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>Infamy shall claim you!&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a26" name="=&gt;a26">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">52</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>You won't live to know that! ::Attack!::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a27" name="=&gt;a27">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
        <mda:meta type="pos_id">54</mda:meta>
      </mda:metadata>
      <segment state="translated">
        <source>::Turn around and leave.::&lt;end&gt;</source>
        <target state="new" />
      </segment>
    </unit>
    <unit id="=&gt;a28" name="=&gt;a28">
      <mda:metadata>
        <mda:meta type="version">1</mda:meta>
